<title>INDIA: India RBI raises 10.61 bln rupees at auction.</title>
<headline>India RBI raises 10.61 bln rupees at auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it accepted bids for a face value of 10.61 billion rupees at an auction of 364-day treasury bills on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield fell to 8.85 percent from 9.0 percent at the last auction.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
